# A project tagged @inbox and carrying other tags is still the inbox, listed apart, and its star lists it in the Starred view.
file <<END
Capture: @inbox @red @star
	- Call mom
Work:
	- Report
END
keys <C-g>
see 󰚇 Capture                                 1 │
see Projects
hide   Capture
keys <Esc> gS
see Capture: 󰓎
quit
